WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.899
These are the top 5 most overpowered devil
fruits in One Piece.

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:05.350
Starting with the Brush fruit.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.350
Yes, that’s right.

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:08.800
We are already starting with a shocker.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.710
And while this fruit may surprise many of
you, let’s take a look at just how incredible

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.830
these powers are.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:20.320
In chapter 754, the samurai Kanjuro first
demonstrates the fruit’s powers . To put

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:25.420
it simply, the fruit allows its user to produce
ink and then anything that is painted with

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.540
this ink can come alive.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.300
And this ability makes it probably THE.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.300
MOST.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.410
ADAPTABLE fruit ever.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.730
Need some food?

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:35.730
Just paint it.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:36.730
Need a way to fly?

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.730
Easy.

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.160
Need an overpowered destructive force of nature?

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:42.480
A robot that can scale the Grand Line?

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:46.870
Want five dragon Kaidos raining down destruction
on the battlefield?

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:48.449
Literally anything is possible!

00:00:48.449 --> 00:00:54.460
Now of course, the strength of the creations
depends on the skill of the artist, but in

00:00:54.460 --> 00:01:00.500
the hands of someone who is really good at
art, this fruit is truly incredible.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:05.049
Although, we initially though the creations
were weak to water, we later learned that

00:01:05.049 --> 00:01:09.049
they are not which makes them even more powerful.

00:01:09.049 --> 00:01:14.290
We’ve even seen Kanjuro create walking,
talking clones of other people.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:19.000
And while these clones seem like they can’t
take much damage, if the user is creative,

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.440
they can still be devastating in battle.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:28.350
The power even allowed Kanjuro to create this
creepy giant bl which set the entirety of

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:39.170
Kaido’s castle on fire and threatened to
take out every single person fighting on the

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.869
island.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:02:29.170
And we don’t even know 

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:51.390
if Kanjuro actually awakened his fruit or
not.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:57.280
Since awakened fruits usually affect their
environment and this one did not, there is

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:05.220
a decent chance that this fruit has an even
more overpowered level that we never got to

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.220
see.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:10.480
One possibility for awakening could allow
the user to turn the environment into ink

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:13.080
which can then be used to create anything.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:19.390
Or maybe the user can awaken different brushes
so that anyone can bring paintings to life.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:24.560
Either way, the Brush fruit feels like one
of the most criminally underrated and insanely

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.690
adaptable devil fruits in the story.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:31.010
And if you were surprised by the Brush fruit
making it into the Top 5, then you won’t

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.590
believe what fruits are at number one and
two on this list.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:41.409
And STILL, it might be NOTING compared to
the terrifying, god-like, life-warping powers

00:03:41.409 --> 00:03:43.060
of the Soul Fruit.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:48.480
In chapter 835, we get an explanation for
the abilities of the fruit’s current user,

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.480
Big Mom.

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:54.200
Basically, the fruit allows the user to manipulate
the soul, also known as life-span, of other

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.200
people.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:01.350
She can take the life-span under certain conditions
and then turn other objects into living, conscious

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.160
beings using this stolen life span.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.440
Like I said, she is literally creating life.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.819
And like the other fruits on this list, it
isn’t simply overwhelmingly powerful in

00:04:11.819 --> 00:04:12.819
battle.

00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:17.130
It also has so many other mind-bending uses
that make the fruit so special.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:21.190
As I already mentioned, Big Mom uses the Soul
fruit to bring objects to life.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:26.870
These are called homies which can move around
and act independently, but they are mostly

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.070
forced to obey her commands.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:34.509
These homies also retain some personality
and memories from the person whose soul they

00:04:34.509 --> 00:04:35.509
were created with.

00:04:35.509 --> 00:04:39.780
Let’s look at some examples of just how
broken this ability truly is.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:44.460
Big Mom basically brought the entire forest
on her island to protect her home from intruders.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.600
She made an army out of chess pieces.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.370
She can animate food and water.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:55.680
She also used her own soul to create special
homies, as we see with Zeus, Prometheus, Napoleon,

00:04:55.680 --> 00:05:03.199
and Hera, which she uses to fly and use elemental
powers such as fire and lightning.

00:05:03.199 --> 00:05:09.090
So basically the user can create life as long
as they have soul available to use.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.340
There are some limitations to these powers.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:17.669
Big Mom is only able to steal life-span from
people who freely offer it or people who are

00:05:17.669 --> 00:05:18.780
afraid of her.

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:23.670
Naturally most people are scared of Big Mom,
but we don’t know if this is a rule for

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.000
the devil fruit or only for Big Mom.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:30.789
For example, could someone else with the fruit
steal life-span from someone they love or

00:05:30.789 --> 00:05:32.319
someone who is weak?

00:05:32.319 --> 00:05:36.419
In addition, souls can’t be infused into
corpses or other living people.

00:05:36.419 --> 00:05:40.850
The homies are also somewhat independent,
and can even betray their creator if they

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:46.380
have enough motivation or, like we see with
Nami, if someone has a vivre card of the Soul

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.380
fruit user.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.690
Soul can also be stolen once it is extracted
from someone else.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:54.890
We have seen another person use this devil
fruit, Mother Carmel.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:06:05.250
Before Big Mom, uhh, ate her, she created
a homie from fire named Pandora.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.389
And while Big Mom was never confirmed to be
awakened, it is possible that the awakening

00:06:09.389 --> 00:06:14.250
of this devil fruit is actually these dark
blobs that we see on whole cake island.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:19.030
These blobs were created by Big Mom and are
able to gather life-span from people who offer

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:20.030
it.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:25.699
So without a doubt, the Soul Fruit is super
powerful and adaptive, able to create devastating

00:06:25.699 --> 00:06:32.110
weapons, bring objects to life, and even transform
entire islands to match the desires of the

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.110
user.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:38.370
Which is absolutely insanely overpowered,
but it doesn’t even come close to this literal

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:44.510
god fruit that broke the entire one piece
fandom when it was revealed in chapter 1044.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:48.270
The Mythical Zoan Human Fruit: Model Sun God
Nika.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:51.560
Of course it had to be on this list.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.970
How could it not?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:59.010
Many previous top devil fruit videos have
never included Luffy’s rubber fruit because,

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:01.840
honestly, it isn’t that great.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:08.310
But since chapter 1044 when we first see Luffy’s
awakening and are told that his fruit is actually

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:15.790
a mythical Zoan, this fruit has become one
of the most overpowered in the entire story.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:20.050
Not only does this fruit turn the user’s
body into rubber, and all the crazy things

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:25.410
we’ve seen Luffy do with that, but upon
awakening they are able to freely manifest

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.419
their imagination in the world.

00:07:28.419 --> 00:07:32.259
Remember all those crazy things you imagined
doing as a kid.

00:07:32.259 --> 00:07:34.150
Well, Luffy can do them.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:38.810
In just the short time since this reveal,
we have seen Luffy turn people and objects

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:39.810
into rubber.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.040
He can catch lightning.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.780
Punch with fire.

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:45.099
Create actual googles out of his hair.

00:07:45.099 --> 00:07:51.250
Who knows, maybe he’ll even be able to imitate
other devil fruits in the future.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:58.380
And all of this on top of having incredible
strength and endurance.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:03.600
One downside of the fruit is that using the
powers is probably costing Luffy his life-span.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:09.470
We are told this by many of his opponents
and can even see him grow incredibly weak

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.159
whenever he is using a new power.

00:08:11.159 --> 00:08:17.120
Besides this weakness, we don’t know the
true limits or even the ultimate powers of

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:20.050
this devil fruit, so make sure to subscribe
to the channel as we will talk all about it

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.050
in future videos.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:24.920
And this devil fruit is another one where
the powers are good on their own, but they

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.310
are significantly enhanced by the person using
the fruit.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:33.529
In this case, Luffy is a perfect match for
the fruit because he can fully utilize his

00:08:33.529 --> 00:08:39.070
joyful spirit and his limitless imagination,
which is probably the reason he was the first

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:42.729
person to awaken it in over 800 years.

00:08:42.729 --> 00:08:48.100
But as ridiculously overpowered as the Nika
fruit is, you’ll probably be surprised to

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:54.620
hear that it still falls short of the reality-bending
powers of the number two fruit on this list.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.320
A fruit that you probably didn’t have on
your radar for this list, but it is easily

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:03.570
second the most insane fruit on this list,
and not for the reasons you might think.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:06.660
And that is Bartholomew kuma’s Paw Fruit.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:12.350
And I can almost guarantee that in chapter
484 when this fruit was introduced that no

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:17.500
one could imagine the absurd capabilities
of this power.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:24.180
When this fruit is eaten, the user’s hands
grow these paw pads which can repel anything.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:26.350
And I mean anything.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:31.200
Swords, ranged attacks, bullets.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:34.899
And that is hardly the limit of its powers.

00:09:34.899 --> 00:09:41.410
We saw in Thriller Bark and Sabaody that the
user can launch people across the world.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.290
They can compress air to make a bomb.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:50.540
And even more mind-blowing is that it can
repel intangible concepts such as pain, and,

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.760
as we learned recently, memories and imagination.

00:09:53.760 --> 00:10:00.580
And this is where the true power of this fruit
lies.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:04.660
If it can truly repel these intangible aspects
of a person then could it also be the way

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:10.500
that some devil fruits are created.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:15.250
I mean the genius scientist Dr. Vegapunk tells
us that devil fruits were born of people’s

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.250
desires.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:21.630
So could it be possible that Kuma or a person
from the past used this devil fruit to repel

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:31.990
a person’s desire in order to create a new
devil fruit?

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:34.150
How insane would that be?

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.930
If you desire to be a soft, bouncy pillow?

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:41.370
Perhaps Kuma can push out your desire and
put it into a devil fruit.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.269
You want to be a mythical unicorn?

00:10:43.269 --> 00:10:45.000
Well, here you go.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:53.060
There may be some limits that we do not know
of yet, but there are some crazy possibilities.

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:57.280
For example, could the user even repel their
own pain?

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.110
This could basically let them heal themselves
whenever they want.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.089
Could they repel a person's age to make them
younger?

00:11:04.089 --> 00:11:06.889
Their personality to change who they are?

00:11:06.889 --> 00:11:12.500
Truly, this fruit is incredibly overpowered
and I personally can’t wait to learn more

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.820
about it along with the number one fruit coming
up next.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:21.850
But before we get there, here are some honorable
mentions that just barely missed out on my

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:22.850
top five.

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:27.700
Now if I had made this list before 2022, I
certainly would have had Law’s Ope-Ope no

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.040
mi on my list.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:33.340
I mean the user basically becomes a god within
their “room”.

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:38.769
And this little girl’s Hobby fruit is another
insane power, as she can literally turn anyone

00:11:38.769 --> 00:11:43.010
she touches into a little toy slave.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:48.450
Also missing out are some of the most destructive
fruits in One Piece like the Magma fruit,

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:53.610
the Tremor fruit, the Light and Darkness fruits,
and even Kaido’s mythical fish fruit which

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:57.210
allows him to unleash the elemental powers
of a dragon.

00:11:57.210 --> 00:12:01.730
But we’re ranking the top 5 devil fruits
that are way too overpowered for what they

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.380
originally were supposed to be.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:09.800
And all of these fruits I just listed do pretty
much exactly what you’d think they do.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.500
Make stuff go boom.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:16.180
But even still, you might be surprised to
learn that despite how incredibly powerful

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:23.370
all of those fruits are, none of them even
comes close to the insanely overpowered abilities

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:24.910
of number one.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:30.600
It’s time to discuss the Brain Fruit.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:36.940
In chapter 1066, we see the famous Dr. Vegapunk
for the first time in a flashback on the ruins

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:39.060
of the scholar island, Ohara.

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:45.450
Now, we always knew that Vegapunk was a genius,
but it completely shocked everyone that he

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.529
was the user of the newly introduced Brain
fruit.

00:12:49.529 --> 00:12:52.550
Just one chapter later, we learn that the
main power this fruit grants is the ability

00:12:52.550 --> 00:13:00.480
to instantly memorize information and limitlessly
store all that knowledge in the user’s head.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:06.190
And while this fruit may not directly be the
best fighting devil fruit, it is incredibly

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:10.519
overpowered based on the effects it has on
the one piece world.

00:13:10.519 --> 00:13:16.199
And I will argue that there is literally no
one in the story who has changed the current

00:13:16.199 --> 00:13:19.490
one piece world as much as Vegapunk.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:24.700
And while we know he was born a genius, the
Brain fruit is what truly allowed him to change

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.700
the world.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.700
And let’s talk about the crazy influence
these powers have in the story.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.260
First, Vegapunk designed these Sea Prism lined,
self-propelled ships, which allows the marines

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.360
to cross the calm belt safely.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:38.620
And while this may not seem like a big deal,
remember that the world is separated by these

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.579
stretches of calm seas and the Red Line.

00:13:41.579 --> 00:13:46.380
Basically, if someone wants to go to one of
the other blues or the Grand Line, they have

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.889
to go through Reverse Mountain, climb the
Red Line, or risk sailing through the calm

00:13:50.889 --> 00:13:52.470
belt.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:14:00.029
So allowing the World Government easy access
to each part of the world is a massive advantage

00:14:00.029 --> 00:14:05.820
over normal people and pirates which allows
them to control the world.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:10.200
And this was all thanks to Vegapunk’s scientific
genius and the Brain Fruit.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.910
Besides the ships, let’s take a look at
the insane fighting forces that Vegapunk has

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.550
created with the help of the Brain fruit.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:22.800
He has made giant robots, armies of super
powered cyborgs, and the Seraphim, which are

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:26.310
nearly invincible genetically enhanced clones.

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:31.350
Seriously, who in the entire world could stand
up to all of these ridiculous battle weapons

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.949
that Vegapunk has created.

00:14:33.949 --> 00:14:38.550
And even more impressive is Vegapunk’s research
into devil fruits.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:43.570
He has successfully cloned other Zoan and
paramecia devil fruits like the Swim fruit,

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.980
the Love fruit, and Kaido’s Mythical Fish
Fruit.

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:52.880
So if he has a whole stockpile of other fruits,
just imagine the army that he could create.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:57.500
And with his brain and enough time, I’m
sure he could even come up with more weapons

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.200
to counter devil fruit abilities.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:04.079
And while many of these advancements were
possible because of the unique combination

00:15:04.079 --> 00:15:08.829
of the Brain fruit and Vegapunk genius, I
think it is fair to say that even a normal

00:15:08.829 --> 00:15:14.009
person who ate this fruit would have the potential
to become a super genius if they decided to

00:15:14.009 --> 00:15:15.009
study enough.

00:15:15.009 --> 00:15:18.730
And the final part of this fruit to discuss
is what a possible awakening could look like.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.529
Other reality-warping paramecia awakenings
that we have seen like Law’s Kroom or Kid’s

00:15:22.529 --> 00:15:27.259
Magnetism have allowed the user to grant powers
of their devil fruit to a part of the environment.

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:32.149
For Vegapunk this could mean that he is able
to gain the memories and knowledge by touching

00:15:32.149 --> 00:15:36.959
other people or objects in the world, thereby
increasing the knowledge that he could gather.

00:15:36.959 --> 00:15:46.459
In my opinion there is not a single devil
fruit out there that even comes close to reaching

00:15:46.459 --> 00:15:50.570
this level of overpowered, but if you want
to prove me wrong and find an ever more op

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:55.860
fruit that no one thought about, check out
this video right here, where I explain ever

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.699
single devil fruit in one piece.

00:15:57.699 --> 00:15:58.500
Shanks for watching.

